204
00:07:45,425 --> 00:07:46,300
Quick check.

205
00:07:46,850 --> 00:07:49,196
What are the method and the path in a request?

206
00:07:49,746 --> 00:07:52,456
What does a four oh four mean, and who made the mistake?

207
00:07:53,006 --> 00:07:56,142
What is the difference between a four hundred and a five hundred?

208
00:07:56,692 --> 00:08:00,169
Which method creates something, and which status code confirms it?

209
00:08:00,719 --> 00:08:03,317
Objective covered: M C zero eight,

210
00:08:03,317 --> 00:08:05,151
objective two: requests,

211
00:08:05,151 --> 00:08:05,915
responses,

212
00:08:05,915 --> 00:08:06,297
rest,

213
00:08:06,297 --> 00:08:07,290
status codes,

214
00:08:07,290 --> 00:08:08,207
and jay son.

